*> RUN FROM JCL JOB LONNIGHT STEP030
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. LON0036.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    COPY LON0036C.
01 WS-RESULTS.
    *> MORTGAGE INSURANCE REQUIRED
    05 MORT-INS-IND       PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    *> RATE ADJUSTMENT
    05 RATE-ADJUSTMENT    PIC 9V9999 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM 3000-LTV-RULES
    DISPLAY "MORT-INS-IND=" MORT-INS-IND
    DISPLAY "RATE-ADJUSTMENT=" RATE-ADJUSTMENT
    STOP RUN.
3000-LTV-RULES.
    IF LOAN-TO-VALUE GREATER THAN 90
        MOVE 'Y' TO MORT-INS-IND
        MOVE 0.0025 TO RATE-ADJUSTMENT
    ELSE
        MOVE 'N' TO MORT-INS-IND
    END-IF.
